invalid type: string "Lost and Damaged Parcel Policy\nDamaged Parcel\nCustomers should document visible damage by taking photographs of the outer packaging, internal\npackaging, and damaged item.\nReport Damage\nDamage should be reported to the sender or courier support as soon as possible. The applicable claim time\nlimit should be checked before submitting a claim.\nLost Parcel\nÿZÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ